                <pb facs="0134" n="46" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg46"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-14"><hi rendition="#italic">May 14,
                        1904</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis advises Mr. Storer that our fleet will arrive at Trieste about July 1
                    and will remain in Austrian waters about two or three weeks.)</p>
            </div>
